  "about": "Two-player demo level 1, Better together (B-054), in co-op: won with its monk in play. A bedrock wall splits the level; each player's half holds the key of the other half's door. Player 1 takes the green key and player 2 the red one; each takes its half's gold from the bar, climbs to the shared top floor and drops its key there, then picks up the other's. Player 1 opens the red door and takes the gold behind it, then the top floor's left gold. Player 2 opens the green door, releasing the monk locked in with the gold; it steps back and digs a hole the monk falls into, takes the gold the monk drops and the top floor's right gold. Player 1 runs to the exit, which wins the level for both.",
